<UserControl x:Class="EduKit.Views.TubaPage"
             xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
             xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
             xmlns:controls="clr-namespace:EduKit.Controls">
    <Grid>
        <Grid.RowDefinitions>
            <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />
            <RowDefinition Height="*" />
        </Grid.RowDefinitions>

        <Grid Grid.Row="0" Margin="0,0,0,12">
            <StackPanel>
                <TextBlock Text="图吧工具箱" Style="{StaticResource H1}" />
                <TextBlock Text="检测本机的图吧工具箱（图拉丁吧工具箱），一键启动其中的硬件检测工具"
                           Style="{StaticResource Sub}" Margin="0,5,0,0" />
            </StackPanel>
            <Border x:Name="CountChip" Style="{StaticResource Chip}" Background="{DynamicResource BgHover}"
                    HorizontalAlignment="Right" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                <TextBlock x:Name="CountText" Text="未检测" FontSize="11"
                           Foreground="{DynamicResource TextSecondary}" />
            </Border>
        </Grid>

        <controls:SmoothScrollViewer Grid.Row="1">
            <StackPanel>
                <Border Style="{StaticResource Card}" Margin="0,0,0,14">
                    <StackPanel>
                        <TextBlock Text="工具箱状态" Style="{StaticResource SectionTitle}" />
                        <TextBlock x:Name="PathText" Text="正在检测…" Style="{StaticResource Body}"
                                   TextWrapping="Wrap" />
                        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,12,0,0">
                            <Button Content="重新检测" Style="{StaticResource BtnPrimarySmall}"
                                    Click="Detect_Click" />
                            <Button Content="选择目录" Style="{StaticResource BtnSmall}" Margin="8,0,0,0"
                                    Click="Browse_Click" />
                            <Button Content="打开目录" Style="{StaticResource BtnSmall}" Margin="8,0,0,0"
                                    Click="OpenFolder_Click" />
                            <Button Content="打开官网" Style="{StaticResource BtnSubtleSmall}" Margin="8,0,0,0"
                                    Click="OpenSite_Click" />
                        </StackPanel>
                        <TextBlock Text="官方下载：https://www.tbtool.cn/   —— 本项目不打包、不重新分发图吧工具箱，仅在检测到本机安装时提供启动入口。"
                                   Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,10,0,0" TextWrapping="Wrap" />
                    </StackPanel>
                </Border>

                <Border Style="{StaticResource Card}" Margin="0,0,0,14">
                    <StackPanel>
                        <Grid Margin="0,0,0,10">
                            <TextBlock Text="工具箱内的工具" Style="{StaticResource SectionTitle}" Margin="0" />
                            <TextBox x:Name="SearchBox" Style="{StaticResource InputBox}" Width="200"
                                     HorizontalAlignment="Right" TextChanged="SearchBox_TextChanged" />
                        </Grid>
                        <ItemsControl x:Name="ToolList">
                            <ItemsControl.ItemsPanel>
                                <ItemsPanelTemplate>
                                    <WrapPanel />
                                </ItemsPanelTemplate>
                            </ItemsControl.ItemsPanel>
                            <ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                                <DataTemplate>
                                    <Button Style="{StaticResource TileButton}" Width="200" Height="66"
                                            Margin="0,0,10,10" Tag="{Binding Path}" Click="Tool_Click">
                                        <StackPanel>
                                            <TextBlock Text="{Binding Name}" Style="{StaticResource H3}"
                                                       TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" />
                                            <TextBlock Text="{Binding Category}" Style="{StaticResource Caption}"
                                                       Margin="0,4,0,0" />
                                        </StackPanel>
                                    </Button>
                                </DataTemplate>
                            </ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                        </ItemsControl>
                        <TextBlock x:Name="EmptyText" Text="没有检测到工具。请先在「选择目录」中指定图吧工具箱所在文件夹。"
                                   Style="{StaticResource Caption}" TextWrapping="Wrap" Visibility="Collapsed" />
                    </StackPanel>
                </Border>

                <Border Style="{StaticResource Card}">
                    <StackPanel>
                        <TextBlock Text="使用说明" Style="{StaticResource SectionTitle}" />
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Body}" TextWrapping="Wrap" LineHeight="24">
                            1. 如果电脑上已经安装图吧工具箱，程序会自动在常见位置查找，也可以手动选择目录；<LineBreak />
                            2. 检测成功后，上方会列出工具箱里的 exe 工具，点击即可启动；<LineBreak />
                            3. 图吧工具箱是第三方免费软件，请从官网 https://www.tbtool.cn/ 下载，本程序不附带其安装包；<LineBreak />
                            4. 硬件检测类工具（如 CPU-Z、AIDA64、CrystalDiskInfo）由对应软件厂商提供，请遵守其许可协议。
                        </TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                </Border>
            </StackPanel>
        </controls:SmoothScrollViewer>
    </Grid>
</UserControl>